{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49504","headline":"临江仙 三 · 顾敻","name":"临江仙 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月色穿帘风入竹，倚屏双黛愁时。\n砌花含露两三枝。\n如啼恨脸，魂断损容仪。\n香烬暗销金鸭冷，可堪孤负前期。\n绣襦不整鬓鬟攲。\n几多惆怅，情绪在天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}